content:
E18 shows the worker holds only 1 open DB connection — no connection exhaustion. The evidence firmly points to the bad deploy as the sole root cause: worker v1.1 crashes repeatedly (E5, E6) starting 35s after deploy (E7), queue backs up to 676 pending messages (E4, E16), no premature acks (E17), no resource exhaustion (E18), and the order-creation surge (E3) started *after* the first crashes, making it a downstream symptom rather than a cause.

